+Source: flann
+Section: libs
+Priority: optional
+Maintainer: Debian Science Maintainers <debian-science-maintainers@lists.alioth.debian.org>
+Uploaders: Leopold Palomo-Avellaneda <leo@alaxarxa.net>,
+	   Jochen Sprickerhof <jspricke@debian.org>,
+Build-Depends: cmake,
+               debhelper-compat (= 13),
+               pkg-config,
+               libboost-dev,
+               libboost-mpi-dev,
+               libboost-system-dev,
+               libboost-serialization-dev,
+               libboost-thread-dev,
+               libgtest-dev,
+               libhdf5-mpi-dev,
+               liblz4-dev,
+               mpi-default-dev, intel-oneapi-compiler-dpcpp-cpp-2024.0, intel-oneapi-dpcpp-ct-2024.0,
+               latex2html, texlive-binaries, texlive-latex-base
+Standards-Version: 4.6.0
+Rules-Requires-Root: no
+Homepage: http://www.cs.ubc.ca/research/flann/
+Vcs-Browser: https://salsa.debian.org/science-team/flann
+Vcs-Git: https://salsa.debian.org/science-team/flann.git
+
+Package: libflann-dev
+Section: libdevel
+Architecture: any
+Multi-Arch: same
+Depends: libflann1.9 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, libboost-dev, libhdf5-mpi-dev, liblz4-dev,
+Description: Fast Library for Approximate Nearest Neighbors - development
+ FLANN is a library for performing fast approximate nearest neighbor searches
+ in high dimensional spaces. It contains a collection of algorithms found
+ to work best for nearest neighbor search and a system for automatically
+ choosing the best algorithm and optimum parameters depending on the dataset.
+ .
+ This package contains development files needed to build FLANN applications.
+
+Package: libflann1.9
+Architecture: any
+Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
+Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
+Multi-Arch: same
+Description: Fast Library for Approximate Nearest Neighbors - runtime
+ FLANN is a library for performing fast approximate nearest neighbor searches
+ in high dimensional spaces. It contains a collection of algorithms found
+ to work best for nearest neighbor search and a system for automatically
+ choosing the best algorithm and optimum parameters depending on the dataset.
+ .
+ This package contains the libraries needed to run FLANN applications.
+
+Package: flann-doc
+Architecture: all
+Section: doc
+Depends: doc-base, ${misc:Depends}
+Description: Fast Library for Approximate Nearest Neighbors - documentation
+ FLANN is a library for performing fast approximate nearest neighbor searches
+ in high dimensional spaces. It contains a collection of algorithms found
+ to work best for nearest neighbor search and a system for automatically
+ choosing the best algorithm and optimum parameters depending on the dataset.
+ .
+ This package contains the documentation for FLANN.
+
+Package: libflann-dpcpp-dev
+Section: libdevel
+Architecture: any
+Multi-Arch: same
+Depends: libflann1.9-dpcpp (= ${binary:Version}), libflann-dev (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends},
+Description: Data Parallel C++ enabled Fast Approximate Nearest Neighbors searching - runtime
+ FLANN is a development library for performing fast approximate nearest neighbor searches
+ in high dimensional spaces optimized using Intel(R) oneAPI.
+
+Package: libflann1.9-dpcpp
+Architecture: amd64
+Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, libflann1.9 (= ${binary:Version}), libze-dev, intel-opencl-icd,
+ intel-oneapi-runtime-dpcpp-cpp-2024, intel-oneapi-runtime-compilers-2024, intel-oneapi-runtime-openmp-2024,
+ libze-intel-gpu1,
+Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
+Multi-Arch: same
+Description: Data Parallel C++ enabled Fast Approximate Nearest Neighbors searching - runtime
+ FLANN is a library for performing fast approximate nearest neighbor searches
+ in high dimensional spaces optimized using Intel(R) oneAPI.
+
+Package: flann-dpcpp-test
+Section: binary
+Architecture: amd64
+Multi-Arch: same
+Depends: libflann1.9-dpcpp (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, libze-dev, intel-opencl-icd,
+Description: Data Parallel C++ enabled Fast Approximate Nearest Neighbors searching - runtime
+ FLANN is a test sample for performing fast approximate nearest neighbor searches
+  in high dimensional spaces optimized using Intel(R) oneAPI.
+
